                "description": "The contract type. Must be 'eor' (Employer of Record) or 'gp' (Global Payroll)."
              },
              {
                "name": "country",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code."
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Lists employee additional info template by the contract type and the employment country\n **Token scopes**: `contracts:read`"
        }
      ]
    }
